  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative infrastructure for social services improved to provide adequate and quality services for working age and elderly population in line with SPF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will contribute to enhancement the country&#x2019;s social protection infrastructure by advocating for shock-responsive systems for workers affected by climate change and identifying policy responses and best practices related to unemployment benefits, partial employment, and active labour market policies (ALMPs). The ILO will work with the Government in preparation to UN Climate Change Conference (COP 29) to advocate for key social protection measures that address climate change impacts, showcasing regional and global best practices during the Conference.</narrative>
  </description>
